diff --git a/docs/CHANGELOG.md b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
index 7c5c35e..b626dbf 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Completion after Unicode text.** Suggestions remain available when emoji precede the cursor, and incomplete-code recovery preserves line endings. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Composer directory references.** PHP completion and navigation follow local vendor and binary-directory setting references, including paths containing spaces. Contributed by @thinkycz
 
 - **Name extracted declarations.** Clients can supply a name for an extracted variable, constant, function or method before reviewing the proposal. Conflicting or invalid names are refused, and omitted names retain automatic naming. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
